OL,3,AGTA 6 - all you need to know about
OL,4,ARockstar's blockbuster game
OL,5,
OL,6,FRockstar has released a new launch
OL,7,Ftrailer for Grand Theft Auto VI,
OL,8,Frevealing more details about what is
OL,9,Fset to be the biggest game of the year.
OL,11,FGTA 6 became available to pre-order at
OL,12,Fmidnight on 25 June in the UK and
OL,13,Felsewhere around the world, after
OL,14,FRockstar revealed the game's pre-sales
OL,15,Flaunch date and cover art in mid-June.
OL,17,FAnalysts believe Rockstar's action
OL,18,Fadventure could become the most
OL,19,Fexpensive game ever made, with
OL,20,Festimates putting development costs at
OL,21,Fmore than $1bn (#866m).
OL,23,APub: 19-JunQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/18
