OL,3,AAI giant Anthropic woos potential
OL,4,Ainvestors ahead of stock market debut
OL,5,
OL,6,FArtificial intelligence (AI) giant
OL,7,FAnthropic has been drumming up support
OL,8,Ffor its expected stock market listing
OL,9,Fas it seeks to reassure investors of
OL,10,Fits profit-making potential.
OL,12,FAnthropic revenue surged by 45% to
OL,13,F$16.8bn (#12.7bn) in the three months
OL,14,Fto the end of September, the BBC
OL,15,Funderstands.
OL,17,FIn common with other AI firms, it is
OL,18,Fseeking to position itself as being
OL,19,Fable to generate huge profits despite
OL,20,Fspending billions on tech.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/18
